entries[251884] = { ["name"] = "Abyss Sabre", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nOne-Hand Sword\n58 - 97 Damage Speed 2.60\n(29.8 damage per second)\n+26 [Agility or Strength]\n+314 Stamina\n+ 31 Haste\n+ 13 Mastery\nDurability 75 / 75\nEquip: Your attacks and abilities have a high chance to deal 970 additional Void damage and apply a Void Tear up to 20 times for 20 sec.\n\nTorment's Duality (0/2)\nAbyss Sabre\nRadiant Foil\n(2) Set : Abyss Sabre applies twice as many Void Tears to your target.\nSell Price:" }
