entries[252421] = { ["name"] = "Rotting Globule", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped\nTrinket\n+4 [Agility or Strength]\nUse: Cover yourself in four fetid pustules, absorbing 768 damage for 15 sec. Each time the shield loses 25% of its value, a pustule erupts, dealing 20 Plague damage split among nearby enemies.\n\nIf all pustules erupt, the final burst deals 11 additional Plague damage. (2 Min Cooldown)\nSell Price:" }
